{"schema_version":1,"paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605","questions":[{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605-q01","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605","source_question_id":"zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605-q01","number":"1","order":1,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"24a163d699bcb7e4d14c2ea9d532f71ec7776a0f0e0914fef368ba831664fe39","body":[{"type":"text","value":"1.自然科学中很多物理量的表达式都有不止一个，通常都有其定义式和决定式，它们反映人们对自然界认识的不同层次.定义式侧重描述客观世界，决定式侧重对因果关系的解释.下列表达式中，侧重解释因果关系的是（）\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"a = { \\frac { F } { m } }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"R = { \\frac { U } { I } }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\varphi = \\frac { E _ { \\mathrm { p } } } { q }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"E = \\frac { F } { q }"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605-q02","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605","source_question_id":"zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605-q02","number":"2","order":2,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5ffad7674a3c95a87462b7c0a9ceaccf03e5691cccb4bc038bc429cec8e8e43e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"2. 2026年央视春晚节目《武BOT》中，人形机器人与武术演员同台完成空翻、舞剑、棍法对练等动作，展现了强大的运动控制与平衡能力。如图甲、乙、丙所示，机器人空翻时，先踏上辅助平台，之后平台向上弹起，将机器人推向空中，辅助机器人完成空翻动作，以下说法正确的是（ ）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5cf5b2413cd466fe659b6bcf986361fcf0ead10b1db5b46276c4c50b0db337cb.png","width":269,"height":251,"width_mm":31.502,"row_group":"zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1c65054e351c10e480017bcf3f5f7f268bcb1c99eb4157782c4ee768105db004.png","width":191,"height":256,"width_mm":22.262,"row_group":"zhenhai-zhongxue-moni-2605-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cd8192ba6ba428dd090be2232d5d7d54849f6226d61bc59ee5e10b7ff1e6f5